<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 90 bln levs 4-wk T-bills next week.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 90 bln levs 4-wk T-bills next week.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer five issues of four-week discount T-bills worth a total of 90 billion levs at daily auctions next week, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with a maximum par of 18 billion levs each and no minimum acceptable price set in advance, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow: </p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER     AUCTION DATE    ISSUE DATE    MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3038197003	 June 9	    June 10	 July 8</p>
<p> BG3038297001	 June 10	   June 11	 July 9</p>
<p> BG3038397009	 June 11	   June 12	 July 10</p>
<p> BG3038497007	 June 12	   June 13	 July 11</p>
<p> BG3038597004	 June 13	   June 16	 July 14</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
